#. <CLT 4>ここが生物室か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, here I am in the bio lab.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …って、寒い！！
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's so cold...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんか、ここって…
#. 異常に寒くないか！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's like...abnormally cold.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まるで冷蔵庫の中みたいだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I feel like I'm in a giant refrigerator.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうして、こんなに寒いんだ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Seriously, why is it so cold!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニターにも…
#. つららが付いてるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are icicles hanging from the monitor...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. 寒さで壊れたりしないのかな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm surprised the surveillance camera can work with\n"
"how cold it is in here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>壁面に、妙な装置が埋め込まれている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's some kind of weird machine or something built\n"
"into the wall.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こういう装置って、どこかで見た事が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I've seen something like this before...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…そうだ。映画とかドラマで見た事あるんだ。
#. 特にホラー系のヤツとかで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Ah, that's it! I've seen this kind of thing in horror\n"
"movies and stuff...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 死体安置所にある…
#. 死体を入れて置く為の冷蔵庫…
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's...a fridge for storing dead bodies."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ、ひょっとして…
#. この生物室も…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does that mean this bio lab is actually...a morgue?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>この部屋の事は…
#. もう少し詳しく調べてみた方がよさそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I should probably take a closer look around...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、映画とかドラマで見た事がある。
#. 死体を入れて置く為の冷蔵庫だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of those fridges they put dead bodies in.\n"
"I've seen 'em on crime shows and stuff...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとしたら、ここにみんなが…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then...does that mean everyone who's died is...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな狭い場所に…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They're all in this little room?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>これって、映画とかドラマで見た事がある。
#. 死体を入れて置く為の冷蔵庫だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of those fridges they put dead bodies in.\n"
"I've seen 'em on crime shows and stuff...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ、ここにみんなが……？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So...is everyone who's died...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. だとすると…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then does that mean...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかして、植物庭園から消えた
#. 戦刃むくろの死体もここに…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Since Mukuro's body disappeared from the\n"
"garden...could it be in here?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>調べたいけど…
#. この冷蔵庫ってどうやって開けるんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to check, but I have no idea how to open this\n"
"thing.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>壁面に、妙な装置が埋め込まれている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's some kind of weird machine or something built\n"
"into the wall.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、こっちの左半分の装置には、
#. 青いランプが点灯しているな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And on the left side, there's a bunch of glowing\n"
"blue lights...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、あっちの方の冷蔵庫には…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But on the other side...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>壁面に、妙な装置が埋め込まれている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's some kind of weird machine or something built\n"
"into the wall.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、こっちの左半分の装置には、
#. 青いランプが点灯してるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And on the left side, there's a bunch of glowing\n"
"blue lights...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、点灯しているのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But only some of the lights are on...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…左半分のランプだけだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The ones on the left.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>右半分のランプは点灯していない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The right-hand lights are off...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …とにかく、
#. これで、ようやくわかったぞ。
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well, looking around, I think I get it..."
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり、間違いない。
#. この部屋は…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It seems clear to me now..."
msgstr ""

#. 死体安置所だったんだ。
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It was a makeshift morgue."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>生物室の秘密<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Bio Lab Secret<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに、あの冷蔵庫のランプ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And about those lights by each slot...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと、あれは冷蔵庫が使用中の場合だけ、
#. 青く点灯する仕組みなんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like it's set up so that when a slot is\n"
"occupied, the blue light comes on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、青いランプの冷蔵庫の中に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which would mean, inside each slot lit up in blue...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犠牲になった…みんなが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...another one of the victims is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>生物室のランプ<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Bio Lab Lights<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>でも…みんながここにいるからって…
#. 感傷に浸ってる時間はないよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't let my emotions take control right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死んだみんなの為に、
#. 今のボクが出来る事は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's only one thing I can do for everyone who's\n"
"died...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕を倒す事だけ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And that's...defeat the mastermind!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. その為にも、捜査を続けないと…
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And to do that, I have to continue my investigation."
msgstr ""

#. 今のボクに出来る事は…それだけだもんな…
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I don't have any other option."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ううっ…寒い…！
#. どうしてこんなに寒いんだ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Urg, so cold! Why's it so cold in here...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まずは、その理由を突き止めよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's the first thing I need to figure out.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何か…薄い冊子が置いてあるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh, there's some kind of booklet here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 取扱説明書…みたいだけど…
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It looks like...an instruction manual."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>当社のご遺体安置用冷蔵庫は、
#. ドライアイスに替わる環境に優しい冷蔵庫なのです。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"We offer an eco-friendly alternative to standard dry\n"
"ice for all your cadaver needs.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>庫内には殺菌灯の他に、エチレンガスを除去する
#. オゾン発生装置を備えております。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"In addition to the germicidal lamps, we also provide\n"
"an ozone generator for the removal of ethylene gas.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>ご遺体を入れていただくだけで、
#. 青いランプが点灯し、自動装置が作動します。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"Simply insert the cadaver, and the blue light will\n"
"let you know the automated systems have activated.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>最適な湿度、温度設定が自動に行われますので…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"Temperature and humidity levels will be adjusted\n"
"automatically for optimum settings.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>どなたでもお手軽に、
#. ご遺体を長持ちさせる事が可能です。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"With our system, anyone can keep a body fresh as a\n"
"daisy for as long as you need!\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>内部のプログラムに異常が生じた場合は、
#. 赤いランプとアラーム音で知らせてくれます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"In the unlikely event of a problem, the red light\n"
"will activate and an alarm will sound immediately.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>また、製品外装はステンレス製ですが、
#. オプションで、皮のシート張りにする事も可能です。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"The exterior is stainless steel, and we do offer an\n"
"optional leather upholstery upgrade package.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって…
#. この冷蔵庫の取扱説明書…だよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is...the instruction manual for the fridge?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …とにかく、
#. これで、ようやくわかったぞ。
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well, looking around, I think I get it..."
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり、間違いない。
#. この部屋は…
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It seems clear to me now..."
msgstr ""

#. 死体安置所だったんだ。
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's some kind of makeshift morgue."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>生物室の秘密<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0063 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Bio Lab Secret<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに、あの冷蔵庫のランプ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And about those lights by each slot...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと、あれは冷蔵庫が使用中の場合だけ、
#. 青く点灯する仕組みなんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like it's set up so that when a slot is\n"
"occupied, the blue light comes on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、青いランプの冷蔵庫の中に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which would mean, inside each slot lit up in blue...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犠牲になった…みんなが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...another one of the victims is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>生物室のランプ<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Bio Lab Lights<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>でも…感傷に浸ってる時間はない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't let my emotions take control right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死んだみんなの為に、
#. 今のボクが出来る事は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's only one thing I can do for everyone who's\n"
"died...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕を倒す事だけ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And that's...defeat the mastermind!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. その為にも、捜査を続けないと…
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And to do that, I have to continue my investigation."
msgstr ""

#. 今のボクに出来る事は…それだけだもんな…
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I don't have any other option."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ビニールシートが束になって置いてある。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a stack of tarps here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ビニールシートって…
#. なんだか、最近よく見るな…
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I've been seeing a lot of those things lately..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鉄製の机…相当冷えてるみたいだし、
#. 手を触れたら皮膚が張り付きそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The desk looks like it's made of metal. It's so cold,\n"
"I bet my hand would stick to it if I touched it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>気を付けないとな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better be careful...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "<CLT 4>...Phải cẩn thận mới được.<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>まだ…調べるべき事があるよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think I'm done in here quite yet...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0080 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0081 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0082 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
